# One more thing

Your `setupWindowLogic()` function is almost 250 lines long. I would split it further:

```js
setupWindowLogic()

createTaskbarButton()

bringToFront()

toggleMaximize()

setupDragging()

setupMinimize()

setupClose()
```

That single change alone will make the whole project dramatically easier to maintain.